    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_PURCHASE_CHARTER": "Purchase Charter",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_PURCHASE_CHARTER_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once a game: Purchase Charter.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Target: a city of a civilization you have met and are at peace with. Not its capital, a holy city or a city with a world wonder. Population 5 or less. Within 6 plots of your borders.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Price: 100 gold per population, plus 2 gold per hammer of the cost of its buildings.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The city joins you with its buildings. Its owner receives the gold, and -4 attitude toward you.",
